Per-pass is ×114 model requests — the median pass of this corpus makes that many
assistant steps (ADR-0010), and a schema is prompt on every one. That is the number
to quote, not the per-call one, and it is what the extension's header states.
Note: pi 1.0.0's `+name` delta form declares *no* tools at all, so every allowlist
above is spelled in full; a delta list would price as nothing and leave the worker tool-less.

